{"t":"Lake Equivocolao","s":"lake-equivocolao-5de69","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Lake_Equivocolao_9b3df3.jpg","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Lake Equivocolao</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Lake Equivocolao\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"153\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lake_Equivocolao_9b3df3.jpg\" width=\"168\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Yawno\">Yawno</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/twisted-waters-world-change\">Twisted Waters World Change</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.10<br/>July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Lake Equivocolao</b> can be found north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a> and south-west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Banuta\">Banuta</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32612,32655,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32612, 32655, 7)</a>). This lake is the only place that <a href=\"#/wiki/Shimmer%20Swimmer\">Shimmer Swimmers</a> can be found. To be able to catch some of them you need throw corpses into the water. The corpses can be from any creature, not necessarily humans.<br/>\n<span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Twisted Waters </i> </span>\n</p><p>Its name may be a combination of many words and/or allusion to many brands (Equivo, Colao, Equivoco, Vocolao, etc.).\n</p><p><b>Tips:</b> there is a perfect place right by the water where you can train so you only have 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime\">slimes</a> on you at the same time. This is perfect if you are trying to get the Shimmer Swimmer so you can train skills at the same time.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Update teaser image\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"352\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Twisted_waters_c6f9eb.gif\" width=\"480\"/></span>\n</p></div>","quests":["twisted-waters-world-change"]}